pfBlockerNG self-hosted pkg repository bootstrap meta-package (ADR-17/39).
Writes /usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/pfblockerng.conf pointing at the pfBlockerNG
GitHub Pages pkg repository (pfblockerng.github.io/pkg).  The post-install
script detects the box edition (CE vs Plus), version, and arch, then writes
a fully-resolved direct conf (no Cloudflare Worker required).  Re-running or
upgrading the meta-package rewrites the conf, keeping it correct across pfSense
OS upgrades (self-heal).  To remove the repo conf, deinstall this package.

Requires first-time bootstrap via add-repo.sh.

WWW: https://github.com/pfBlockerNG/pfBlockerNG
